{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id103859439"}, "name":{"label":"Steve Steinitz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-22T22:21:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.13"}, "id":{"label":"13877503009"}, "title":{"label":"Doesn’t sync from iOS to Mac"}, "content":{"label":"I bookmark articles every morning, with Anybox, on my M1 iPad Pro.  I bookmarked several articles a couple days ago.  I’m looking at my bookmarks on my Mac. The most recent bookmarks I can see are from 2 months ago.\n\nI’ve tried all suggestions.  Both devices report syncing is on and up to date a few minutes ago.  Sometimes discarding the bookmarks on Mac and re-syncing them works, other times not.\n\nThe tagging etc is pretty good (so two stars) but the syncing issue reduces the utility of the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1593408455&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
